      "content": "i get that people argue about it, but isn't it pretty much a fact that free trade agreements like the TPP just cause deindustrialization and destroy manufacturing jobs in developed countries? like, even if the macro numbers look okay, the reality for factory workers is pretty much just losing their livelihoods. wouldn't you say the net effect on the working class was negative?",
